    },
    {
      "trait": "Direct sowing",
      "text": "Direct sowing: Not used for garden cultivars."
    },
    {
      "trait": "Transplanting",
      "text": "Transplanting: Plant bulbs in fall, generally about three bulb-heights deep."
    },
    {
      "trait": "Safety",
